    },
    {
      "displayText": "我说你啊，打宝可梦对战的时候\n有没有活用招式的陷阱？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BF44F60554AFF0C62535B9D53EF68A65BF96218768465F65019000A67096CA167096D3B752862DB5F0F768496779631FF1F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陷阱就是使用部分招式后\n留在地面上的效果。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "967796315C31662F4F7F752890E8520662DB5F0F540E000A75595728573097624E0A76846548679C300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "留在地面上的火焰和岩石，\n或是会阻碍对手移动，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n或是会让对手接触后受到伤害。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75595728573097624E0A7684706B7130548C5CA977F3FF0C000A6216662F4F1A963B788D5BF9624B79FB52A8FF0C00100001BE00000A6216662F4F1A8BA95BF9624B63A589E6540E53D752304F245BB3300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陷阱到底有多恐怖？\n我可以教教你。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9677963152305E956709591A60506016FF1F000A621153EF4EE5655965594F60300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是有决心通过对战来学习，\n就跟我说一声吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F670951B35FC3901A8FC75BF9621867655B664E60FF0C000A5C318DDF62118BF44E0058F05427300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要和我这个陷阱招式行家\n打一场试试吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8981548C62118FD94E2A9677963162DB5F0F884C5BB6000A62534E00573A8BD58BD55417FF1F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "打一场！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62534E00573AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我准备一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621151C659074E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "准备啊……\n有什么准备能避开陷阱吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "51C65907554A20262026000A67094EC04E4851C6590780FD907F5F00967796315417FF1F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的宝可梦的所有招式\n都是能设下陷阱的招式！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845B9D53EF68A676846240670962DB5F0F000A90FD662F80FD8BBE4E0B96779631768462DB5F0FFF0100100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你能不能顺利避开陷阱呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6080FD4E0D80FD987A5229907F5F00967796315462FF1F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦～我设了那么多陷阱，\n没想到你还是能打赢啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E6FF5E62118BBE4E8690A34E48591A96779631FF0C000A6CA160F352304F608FD8662F80FD62538D62554A300200100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，地面上有陷阱的时候\n打起来还是很棘手的吧？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŃ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 768,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C573097624E0A670996779631768465F65019000A62538D7767658FD8662F5F8868D8624B76845427FF1F00100002011401430000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
